  "description": "Modbus RTU over TCP server for energy meters connected through RS485-to-Ethernet gateways (e.g. USR DR134 in transparent TCP client mode). Listens on a configurable port, identifies devices by registration packet or remote IP, polls a per-meter register map and stores decoded readings through ITBees FAS repositories. Ships EF Core model registration in the FAS convention.",
